# 24. The Mobbin product, reduced to its actual capability stack

At the highest level, Mobbin currently consists of:

**1. Reference library**  
Screens + UI elements + flows + animations + app/site content.

**2. Structured taxonomy**  
Apps + categories + screen patterns + UI elements + flow actions + screenshot text + site sections/styles.

**3. Search engine**  
Keyword/plain-language search + filters + sorting + screenshot-text search + Deep Search.

**4. Visual discovery**  
Visual search + similar screens + zoom + previews.

**5. Flow inspection**  
